                        "entry_id": "b027270e-d74c-3455-9d57-125831ca18d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A quantity found in a game."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "404d9fe8-05fc-4eb9-8f10-5931f02cecce",
                                "sense_id": "a2e3b272-3caa-38c9-871f-d1f6d10c275b",
                                "text": "I LOVE MY ANTEATER WITH AN A and everything else absurd, bewitching, exotic, and zoo-phile-ic from A to Z in a gameful of laughter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f5e3175-8195-432f-afbb-076c37e849c0",
                                "sense_id": "a2e3b272-3caa-38c9-871f-d1f6d10c275b",
                                "text": "Bengston doing a roomful of painting is like Joe Willie Namath doing a gameful of curl patterns, Jason Robards doing an eveningful of O'Neill, Tina Turner doing a concertful of. . . . and so on."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "232855f2-0424-48b8-80fd-2f0c92c52c30",
                                "sense_id": "a2e3b272-3caa-38c9-871f-d1f6d10c275b",
                                "text": "Suddenly there are new gamefuls of moves that can be duplicated and perhaps even improved on as things in themselves."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
